  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the line be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;- intercept :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;- intercept :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> of reciprocals of the intercepts :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> line always passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
